 with maintenance dose until 24hours post-delivery or since the last episode of convulsion:", "runs": [{"text": "Draw 10mls (5gms) of 50% magnesium sulfate into each syringe 1ml of "}, {"text": "A", "bold": true}, {"text": ": 2% lidocaine in each syringe then give deep IM into each buttock. Continue with maintenance dose until 24hours post-delivery or since the last episode of "}, {"text": "convulsion:"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1429"}}, {"id": "body-11121", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-11122", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "With magnesium sulfate infusion 1g per hour (in 200–300 ml of Ringer’s Lactate),", "runs": [{"text": "With"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "magnesium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sulfate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infusion"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1g"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "per"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hour"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "200–300"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ml"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ringer’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Lactate),"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1429"}}, {"id": "body-11123", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-11124", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Magnesium sulfate 5g undiluted 50% of magnesium sulfate injection (add 1ml of lidocaine 2%) apply deep intra- muscular (IM) injection into each buttock every 4hrs for about 24 hours after delivery or the last seizure whichever come last.", "runs": [{"text": "Magnesium sulfate 5g undiluted 50% of magnesium sulfate injection (add 1ml of lidocaine 2%) apply deep intra- muscular (IM) injection into each buttock every 4hrs for about 24 hours after delivery or the last seizure whichever come last."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1429"}}, {"id": "body-11126", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If having 10% (W/V) A: magnesium sulfate Loading dose 4 gm = 4 ampules given direct I/V slowly for 30 minutes, Maintenance dose 8gm = 8 Ampules in 500mls of R/L or N/S to run for 8 hours then repeat until 24 hours to make total of 3 doses in 24 hours.", "runs": [{"text": "If having 10% (W/V) "}, {"text": "A: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "magnesium sulfate Loading dose 4 gm = 4 ampules given direct I/V slowly for 30 minutes, Maintenance dose 8gm = 8 Ampules in 500mls of R/L or N/S to run for 8 hours then repeat until 24 hours to make total of 3 doses in 24 hours."}]}, {"id": "body-11127-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: The magnesium sulfate infusion should only be given if patellar reflexes are present, respiration rate is ≥ 12 per minute, and urine output is >100mls in 4 hours.", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "magnesium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sulfate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infusion"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "only"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "given"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patellar"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reflexes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "present,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "respiration"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "≥"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "12"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "per"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "minute, and urine output is >100mls in 4 hours."}]}, {"id": "body-11129", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If convulsions recur within 15 minutes give;", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "convulsions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recur"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "within"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "15"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "minutes"